    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaini kūmūlaga Abeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Adamu ūlaala nū nke ū Eva, nūlūgīkī, Hawa ūbūūcha nda ūmyala Kaini; ūhaya gīkī, “Ū SEEBA wanigunanha nabyala ng'wana ngosha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūmyala na Abeli, nzunaye wa ng'wa Kaini. Ū Abeli akabiza ndīīmi, alīyo ū Kaini ūbiza nīmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe ū Kaini ūkamfunīja manong'ho ū SEEBA kwīngīīla ū mu matwajo ga mu ngūnda gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Abeli ūfunya manong'ho ga mbyalwa ja kwandya ja mu mitugo jakwe, na mazezele gajo. Ū SEEBA ūng'wanukūla na būyegi ū Abeli, na a manong'ho gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo atanyegelile ū Kaini, na a manong'ho gakwe; ū mhayo gwenūyo gūnsaayīcha no ū Kaini, ūyikala amining'halile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Kaini gīkī, “Nibūlī wasaayile gīko? Mhayo kī gūlīkwenheleja kwikala ūmining'halile? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū bebe ūlū wīta yawiza, ūtanukūlwa? Alīyo ūlū ūtatūngīlīgije managa gīkī, shilīho shibi a ha nyango gwako shikulindilile, nīyo shikūkūmbūlile no; gwike īkwigeleelilwe ūshipyene!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū Kaini ūng'wīla ū nzunaye gīkī, “Tūjage kū ngūnda.” Aho balī mu ngūnda, kwimanīla ū Kaini wang'ūbūkīla ū nzunaye ū Abeli, ūmūlaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūmūja ū Kaini gīkī, “Alī halī ū nzunayo ū Abeli?” Nang'hwe ūshosha alīhaya, “Natamanile; ū nene nalī nang'hani wa nzuna wane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Wītaga mhayo kī? Managa gīkī a mininga ga ng'wanong'wing'we galīnilīlīīla kūfuma a ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha, ū bebe wazumagwa; wapeejiagwa ūyīngīle ī sī īyo yanukūlaga mininga ga nzunayo kūfuma mu nkono gwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wīlīma ī sī ītūkwinha matwajo gose gose; ūkūbiza nyūngi sagala ū mu sī, wa kwikala wibakīla nūūlū ndūhū mhayo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Kaini ūng'wīla ū SEEBA gīkī, “Ū nsango gwane gwanididohela no, gūkūnilemeela ūmo nagūbūūkīje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī wanipeeja ī lelo ū mu sī, nū kūnilola ūtūnilola; nabizaga munhū wa kūja akūyūngaga sagala ū mu sī, nīyo nakūyikala nogohaga, nguno ose ose ūyo ūnibona adūgije kūnibūlaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA ūng'wīla gīkī, “Yaya ītī gīko; munhū ose ose ūyo ūmūlaga Kaini, akūlīpīlwa shiilī ng'hangala mpungatī.” Hūna ū SEEBA ūntūūlīla lūmeng'ho ū Kaini, lwa koolecha gīkī ūyo ūmona atizūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Kaini wīnga ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūūkazenga mu sī ya Nodi, kīya ya Edeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Kaini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Kaini ūlaala nū nke wakwe, ūbūūcha nda ūmyala Enoka; ū mu shikū jenījo ū Kaini wazengaga nzengo nebe, ūgwitana lina lya ng'witūnja wakwe Enoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Enoka akamyala Iladi, ū Iladi ūmyala Mehuyaeli; ū Mehuyaeli ūmyala Metushaeli, ū Metushaeli ūmyala Lameki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lameki akatoola mhalī, ūmò wa bake bakwe witanagwa Ada, ū ūngī Zila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ada ūmyala Jabali, ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo akabiza ise wa badīīmi, abo bakikalaga mu numba ja maheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzunaye witanagwa Jubali, ū ng'wene ūbiza ise wa bose a batūji ba ndono na a bafuuji ba mbilūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Zila nang'hwe ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, lina lyakwe Tubali-kaini; ū ng'wene akabiza nsuji wa shiseme sha būlī mbika, kūfuma mu chūma shaaza na shapi. Ū Tubali-kaini walī n'ilūmbūye witanagwa Naama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū Lameki ūbawīla",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Adamu akalaala hangī nū nke wakwe ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Seti. Nguno akahaya gīkī, “Ū Mulungu waninha ng'wana ūngī a ha ng'wanya gwa ng'wa Abeli, ūyo Kaini akamūlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seti nang'hwe ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Enoshi, ū mu shikū jenījo a banhū hū bandya kūlīkumūcha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūlīkumūcha:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūlīkumīlīja.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ī lina lya ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
